OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatchy rain,
OL,6,Ffor some, and strong winds this
OL,7,Fevening, but these will gradually ease
OL,8,Fovernight. From midnight, it will be
OL,9,Fdry and breezy with some clear spells,
OL,10,Fthough cloud will start to thicken
OL,11,Fagain before dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FAnother wet and windy day as
OL,14,FStorm Boelo pushes eastwards.
OL,15,FWidespread heavy rain and strong winds
OL,16,Fwith isolated gales possible in
OL,17,Fexposed areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
