OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA
OL,6,Fdrier, brighter day on Sunday although
OL,7,Fremaining windy until the evening.
OL,8,FAfter a quiet Monday morning, rain and
OL,9,Fstrong winds will return later.
OL,10,FIsolated showers and gales on Tuesday.
